{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Abram went up… toward the Negev.</b> To go to the south of the Land of Israel, as it says above, ״הָלוֹךְ וְנָסוֹעַ הַנֶּגְבָּה״ — to Mount Moriah. And in any case, when he goes from Egypt to the land of Canaan, he travels from south to north, for the land of Egypt is to the south of the land of Israel, as is proven by the stations and by the boundaries of the land."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:28.819435346Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}